  <para style="h">Feilimende Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Feilimende Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Feilimen</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt1">Feilimende Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de oluzhi bafanzi sousan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, gaijiu <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ghala bijien oresan hhantu wilie giesan <char style="pn">Feilimen</char>, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>oqinjiu <char style="pn">Yafeiya</char>, bijienre hhantu budui danlasan <char style="pn">Yajibu</char>, pse chii giede hhantulasan jiohuini kunlade xin huaizho. <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Mai ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feilimenni Oreku, Xianxin Gieku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Bi niefanie bi zunjisan chanqiku Hudade chii qiizhi mafan kieliekushi <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>bi chenliese chi soyuji shentulade orezhi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giezho. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Bi onxian giese chi xianxin giekughala laiwon giesanlai zoin khizheghadene Mexihai sudoro matande bisan gounilai man goude mejie giezho. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Gaijiu, chi orezhi shentulai futanshighase biye hende bayasuzhi zhughene teiwo.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aniximude Oluzhi Xiahua Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Ingiese bi Mexihai miende danzine fugiedaghazhi chii fenfulazhi indan giekui giegha shidanema, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>bi oreku zhugheghala chii xiahua gieye. Bi oqio kun, Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de oluzhi bafanzi soudene <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/><char style="pn">Aniximu</char>de oluzhi chii xiahua gieye. Bi bafanzide bikude bi hhende xinyan jiere ada danlazho. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Melieshi hhe chade yama zoin uwoma, ede matan ghualade zoin wine.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Bi ede hhei peizhi chii hhende khareizhi echighaye. Hheshi mii zhughe jieredu kun wo. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Benlai bi hhei enende feilieghazhi bi gouxioxide oluzhi bafanzi soukude chii oronde goyane ushilaghane giezhoma, <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>chi tunyi wise bi ingiezhi gieku duran uwo. Chi gouni giese mienqian ulie giezhi goya duralazhi gie giezho. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Hhei zhanshi jiere chase likai gieghakushi kenen chighala chanqi hhantulaghane giezho. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Ede hheshi zinie hoji pusho, oresan gaijiu wo. Kunni fanmien, Ezhanni fanmiende uzhese made oluzhi ingiezho, chade oluzhi genjia qingiene.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Ingiese chi mii lienshou danlaghazhoshi mii jienlieku mutun hhei jienlie. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Hhe chade yan kuighazhi chade yan chaizhoshi man mii zhan jiere jila. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Bi honjiye. Eneshi bi qinsi huaisan wo. Chi made yan chaisei bu kielieye. Chii aminshi bi ogisan wo. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Gaijiuya, Ezhanyi miende made banman nie gie. Mexihai miende mii zhughede futanshigha!<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Chi mii kielienyi chenliekui bi hende xianxin giezhi xin huaizho. Chi bi kieliesanse da olon giekui bi mejiene. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Pse chi made souku oron nie zhunbei gie. Huda tai onxian giesanyi dain giezhi mii tai hhende echighakui bi xiwon giezho.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihoude Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de oluzhi bighala hhantu bafanzi sousan <char style="pn">Ibafu</char> chade kielien asazho. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Bighala hhantu wilie giesan <char style="pn">Make</char>, <char style="pn">Yalidagu</char>, <char style="pn">Jima</char>, <char style="pn">Lujia</char> man chade kielien asazho.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai nenjien tanre hhantu bi gie. Amine!<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
